Public Deposits (Borrowed Fund-Medium-Term Finance)
Public deposits refer to unsecured deposits
invited from the public. A company wishing
to invite public deposits places an
advertisement in newspapers. Any member
of the public can fill up the prescribed form
and deposit money with the company.
